.0 Q346.0,287.0 346.0,291.0 L346.0,293.0 Q346.0,297.0 342.0,297.0 L170.0,297.0 Z" fill="#2a78d6"/><title>MBPP: MAS uses 5.05× the input tokens of SAS</title></g><g><path d="M170.0,299.0 L352.5,299.0 Q356.5,299.0 356.5,303.0 L356.5,305.0 Q356.5,309.0 352.5,309.0 L170.0,309.0 Z" fill="#1baf7a"/><title>MBPP: MAS uses 5.56× the output tokens of SAS</title></g><text x="353.0" y="296.0" font-size="12.5" fill="#16202a" text-anchor="start" font-weight="600">5.0×</text><text x="363.5" y="308.0" font-size="12" fill="#596774" text-anchor="start">5.6×</text><text x="158.0" y="340.5" font-size="13.5" fill="#16202a" text-anchor="end">DS-1000</text><g><path d="M170.0,325.5 L327.5,325.5 Q331.5,325.5 331.5,329.5 L331.5,331.5 Q331.5,335.5 327.5,335.5 L170.0,335.5 Z" fill="#2a78d6"/><title>DS-1000: MAS uses 4.42× the input tokens of SAS</title></g><g><path d="M170.0,337.5 L404.5,337.5 Q408.5,337.5 408.5,341.5 L408.5,343.5 Q408.5,347.5 404.5,347.5 L170.0,347.5 Z" fill="#1baf7a"/><title>DS-1000: MAS uses 8.97× the output tokens of SAS</title></g><text x="338.5" y="334.5" font-size="12.5" fill="#16202a" text-anchor="start" font-weight="600">4.4×</text><text x="415.5" y="346.5" font-size="12" fill="#596774" text-anchor="start">9.0×</text><text x="158.0" y="379.0" font-size="13.5" fill="#16202a" text-anchor="end">HoVer</text><g><path d="M170.0,364.0 L185.8,364.0 Q189.8,364.0 189.8,368.0 L189.8,370.0 Q189.8,374.0 185.8,374.0 L170.0,374.0 Z" fill="#2a78d6"/><title>HoVer: MAS uses 1.2× the input tokens of SAS</title></g><g><path d="M170.0,376.0 L283.2,376.0 Q287.2,376.0 287.2,380.0 L287.2,382.0 Q287.2,386.0 283.2,386.0 L170.0,386.0 Z" fill="#1baf7a"/><title>HoVer: MAS uses 2.94× the output tokens of SAS</title></g><text x="196.8" y="373.0" font-size="12.5" fill="#16202a" text-anchor="start" font-weight="600">1.2×</text><text x="294.2" y="385.0" font-size="12" fill="#596774" text-anchor="start">2.9×</text></svg>
